{"seq":2,"slug":"mandatory-voluntary-recall-decision-mechanism","title":"强制召回与自愿召回的判定机制及平台-卖家-供应商责任分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-product-recall-safety-response/recall-regime-liability-model/mandatory-voluntary-recall-decision-mechanism","wordCount":2867,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"强制召回与自愿召回的判定机制及平台-卖家-供应商责任分配\">强制召回与自愿召回的判定机制及平台-卖家-供应商责任分配</h1><p>跨境卖家最容易犯的错误，是把召回当成一次&quot;公关事件&quot;而不是&quot;监管事件&quot;。当一件商品在德国 Safety Gate 上被通报，或在亚马逊后台被标记为 unsafe product，真正决定损失规模的既不是运费的绝对值，也不是公关稿的措辞，而是两件事：召回是走自愿通道还是被强制接管，以及账单最终落在平台、卖家还是工厂的哪一方。这两个问题都有可计算的判定结构，而不是靠谈判桌上的气势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-自愿与强制是同一连续区间的两端\">核心概念：自愿与强制是同一连续区间的两端</h2><p>监管机构不会区分&quot;好公司主动召回&quot;和&quot;坏公司被迫召回&quot;作为道义评价，它只关心一个工程事实：危害信息何时、以何种质量进入监管视野。自愿召回的本质，是企业在监管机构掌握足够证据之前，自己完成了风险评估、范围界定和纠正行动计划，并把结论提交给监管方审核。强制召回则是监管方先形成&quot;存在重大产品危害&quot;的认定，再以行政命令或法院禁令的形式强制企业执行。二者的分界线不是危害严重度，而是<strong>监管方是否已经先于企业完成定性</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[安全信号: 客诉/退货/事故/抽检/平台预警] --&gt; B[内部风险初筛]&#10;  B --&gt; C{是否可能造成严重伤害&lt;br/&gt;或违反强制标准?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[记录理由&lt;br/&gt;持续监测]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[启动正式风险评估&lt;br/&gt;危害严重度 x 暴露量]&#10;  E --&gt; F{是否达报告门槛?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| D&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[法定报告窗口内通报监管方]&#10;  G --&gt; H{企业是否先提交&lt;br/&gt;完整纠正行动计划?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[自愿召回&lt;br/&gt;联合公告 企业主导节奏]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| J[监管方先行认定&lt;br/&gt;强制召回/禁令]&#10;  I --&gt; K[执行 回收 修复 退款]&#10;  J --&gt; K&#10;  K --&gt; L[效果核查&lt;br/&gt;完成率是否达标]&#10;  L --&gt;|未达标| M[扩大触达/升级措施]&#10;  M --&gt; L&#10;  L --&gt;|达标| N[申请终止召回&lt;br/&gt;归档证据链]&#10;  D --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[安全信号: 客诉/退货/事故/抽检/平台预警] --&gt; B[内部风险初筛]\n  B --&gt; C{是否可能造成严重伤害&lt;br/&gt;或违反强制标准?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[记录理由&lt;br/&gt;持续监测]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[启动正式风险评估&lt;br/&gt;危害严重度 x 暴露量]\n  E --&gt; F{是否达报告门槛?}\n  F --&gt;|否| D\n  F --&gt;|是| G[法定报告窗口内通报监管方]\n  G --&gt; H{企业是否先提交&lt;br/&gt;完整纠正行动计划?}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[自愿召回&lt;br/&gt;联合公告 企业主导节奏]\n  H --&gt;|否| J[监管方先行认定&lt;br/&gt;强制召回/禁令]\n  I --&gt; K[执行 回收 修复 退款]\n  J --&gt; K\n  K --&gt; L[效果核查&lt;br/&gt;完成率是否达标]\n  L --&gt;|未达标| M[扩大触达/升级措施]\n  M --&gt; L\n  L --&gt;|达标| N[申请终止召回&lt;br/&gt;归档证据链]\n  D --&gt; A</pre><p>这张图里最关键的节点是 <code>G</code>：法定报告窗口。它通常极短，而且是&quot;取得信息&quot;起算而非&quot;确认缺陷&quot;起算。美国《消费品安全法》（CPSA）第 15(b) 条要求制造商、进口商、分销商和零售商，在获得&quot;合理支持产品存在可造成重大产品危害的缺陷&quot;这一结论的信息后 <strong>24 小时内</strong>向 CPSC 报告。这个窗口不是留给企业完成完整调查的，而是留给企业决定&quot;要不要先报&quot;。报早了可以后续修订范围，报晚了则直接落入民事罚款和强制程序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"触发阈值-重大产品危害的形式化\">触发阈值：重大产品危害的形式化</h2><p>&quot;重大产品危害&quot;（substantial product hazard）在 CPSA 下被定义为一种缺陷模式：因产品未达到消费者合理预期的安全水平，或违反消费品安全规则，而可能造成严重伤害或死亡的风险。它与&quot;已经发生伤害&quot;无关——概率足够大加上后果足够重，就构成危害。工程上可以用期望危害来逼近这个判断：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[H] = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} p_i \\cdot s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 类失效模式的发生概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是其伤害严重度（可用 INESS 或 AIS 分级近似）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[H]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 超过内部阈值，或任一 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 达到&quot;可能致死/致残&quot;档位时，判定应直接指向报告与召回。这里的纪律是：<strong>严重度是硬约束，概率只是权重</strong>。一个百万分之三但可致死儿童的缺陷，其判定结果与一个 5% 发生率但仅致轻微皮疹的缺陷完全不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判定问题</th>\n<th>指向召回</th>\n<th>指向不召回</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>是否违反强制安全标准或认证要求？</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后果严重度是否达到重伤/死亡档位？</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>仅轻微可逆伤害</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否已出现重复的失效模式（非单点偶发）？</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>单起且暴露总量极小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是设计缺陷还是单批工艺波动？</td>\n<td>设计缺陷</td>\n<td>单批可隔离的工艺偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺陷产品是否已大量流入消费者手中？</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>绝大部分仍可控于渠道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否存在有效补救（维修/换件/退款/软件升级）？</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>无可行的纠正措施</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>撤回本身是否会造成更大风险？</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（须书面论证，非成本借口）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是唯一允许导向&quot;替代纠正措施&quot;的正当路径：当产品承担必要功能且替代方案风险更高时，可以采取就地整改加显著警示，但必须留下书面论证。任何纯粹出于成本考量的&quot;不召回&quot;结论，在监管审查中都站不住脚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主要法域的强制-自愿分界\">主要法域的强制/自愿分界</h2><p>不同法域的差异不在&quot;要不要召回&quot;，而在报告窗口、召回主体和监管方强制权的落点。跨境经营意味着同一批货可能同时触发多个法域的独立义务。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>法域</th>\n<th>核心法规</th>\n<th>报告义务</th>\n<th>强制权限与特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>美国</td>\n<td>CPSA 第 15(b) 条（<a href=\"https://www.cpsc.gov\">cpsc.gov</a>）</td>\n<td>取得信息后 24 小时内报 CPSC</td>\n<td>CPSC 可提起行政申诉并申请法院禁令，实施强制召回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧盟</td>\n<td>GPSR 法规 (EU) 2023/988，2024-12-13 起适用</td>\n<td>经 Safety Business Gateway 不迟延通报</td>\n<td>Safety Gate 快速预警，成员国市场监督机构可责令撤回/召回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧盟</td>\n<td>产品责任指令 (EU) 2024/2853</td>\n<td>不影响召回义务，影响赔偿</td>\n<td>2026-12-09 起对投放市场产品适用，含软件缺陷推定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中国大陆</td>\n<td>《消费品召回管理暂行规定》（市场监管总局令第 22 号，2020-01-01 施行）</td>\n<td>生产者获知缺陷后限期向省级市场监管部门报告</td>\n<td>生产者是召回第一责任人，市场监管总局可责令召回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>澳大利亚</td>\n<td>澳大利亚消费者法（ACL），ACCC 主管</td>\n<td>知悉后须通知 ACCC</td>\n<td>ACCC 与部长可发布强制召回令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英国</td>\n<td>通用产品安全条例 2005，OPSS 主管</td>\n<td>向 OPSS/地方主管机构报告</td>\n<td>OPSS 可发布召回通知与纠正措施要求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>欧盟这一列尤其要注意 GPSR 引入的两个结构性变化：其一，&quot;责任人&quot;（responsible person，GPSR 第 16 条）必须常驻欧盟境内，承担与监管方沟通的法定接口；其二，召回通知的内容被强制规定（GPSR 第 36 条），必须说明缺陷、风险、消费者应采取的即时行动以及补救方式，措辞不能含糊。这意味着跨境卖家无法再躲在离岸主体后面——欧盟境内的责任人会成为召回程序的直接对象，并向下游追偿至非欧盟卖家。上述各法域的窗口期口径（起算时刻、自然日还是工作日、容许量）与具体报送入口，在 <a href=\"notification-timeline-regulator-interface-map\">分法域通报时限、报告义务与监管接口矩阵</a> 中有逐条展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平台-卖家-供应商的三方责任分配\">平台-卖家-供应商的三方责任分配</h2><p>在跨境链路里，产品从工厂到消费者手里往往经过四层：供应商（工厂）→ 卖家（跨境商家）→ 平台（亚马逊/TikTok Shop/Temu 等）→ 消费者。召回成本要在这条链上分配，而分配的依据不是&quot;谁离消费者近&quot;，而是&quot;谁承担了法定报告义务、谁控制了可追溯数据、谁的行为造成了缺陷&quot;。</p>\n<p>平台的角色是&quot;渠道放大器 + 政策执行者&quot;。主流平台的召回政策通常要求卖家在<strong>获知召回或安全事故后 24 小时内</strong>通知平台，并立即停止该 ASIN 的销售；平台随后下架链接、冻结库存、撤销 FBA 履约，必要时向已购消费者群发通知。平台在多数法域不是&quot;生产者&quot;，因此不承担产品缺陷的实体责任，但它可以依据平台条款把执行成本和商誉损失转嫁给卖家。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>责任维度</th>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>卖家</th>\n<th>供应商/工厂</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发报告义务（CPSA/GPSR）</td>\n<td>转达消费者投诉</td>\n<td>法定报告主体</td>\n<td>提供缺陷与批次数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>召回范围界定</td>\n<td>提供销售与流向数据</td>\n<td>主导界定</td>\n<td>提供 BOM 与批次映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费者触达与退款</td>\n<td>站内信/订单通知通道</td>\n<td>承担退款与运费</td>\n<td>按合同分担货款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存与在途处置</td>\n<td>冻结、退回、销毁</td>\n<td>决定处置方式</td>\n<td>承担召回件成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监管罚款与诉讼</td>\n<td>一般不承担</td>\n<td>首先承担，再追偿</td>\n<td>按合同与过错分担</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据可追溯性</td>\n<td>订单链路</td>\n<td>卖家持有</td>\n<td>生产批次记录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>维权与追偿的胜负手在<strong>可追溯数据</strong>。如果卖家无法把有缺陷的批次映射到具体供应商、生产日期与出货批次，追偿就无从谈起。因此常态化的批次追溯（批号、生产日期、出货单号、目的仓）不是合规装饰，而是召回时的财务防线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"责任分配的合同化落地\">责任分配的合同化落地</h2><p>责任分配不写在合同里就等于不存在。跨境卖家需要在供货合同和平台入驻协议两个方向同时布防。供货合同里应明确：供应商对因设计和制造缺陷引发的召回承担直接成本，并约定提供批次级追溯数据和缺陷调查配合义务；同时约定追偿的举证责任倒置，即由供应商证明其批次无缺陷。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"create table recall_liability_allocation (&#10;  id               bigserial primary key,&#10;  recall_id        bigint not null references recall_case(id),&#10;  party            text   not null check (party in (&#39;platform&#39;,&#39;seller&#39;,&#39;supplier&#39;)),&#10;  obligation       text   not null,&#10;  cost_share       numeric not null check (cost_share between 0 and 1),&#10;  evidence_ref     text,          -- 指向批次追溯或缺陷调查报告&#10;  recovered_amount numeric,&#10;  status           text   not null default &#39;pending&#39;&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> table</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> recall_liability_allocation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id               </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> primary key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recall_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> references</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recall_case(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  party            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (party </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'platform'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'seller'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'supplier'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  obligation       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cost_share       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cost_share </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">between</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_ref     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 指向批次追溯或缺陷调查报告</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recovered_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>平台方向则要预先理解入驻协议中的主动权条款：平台有权在接到监管通知后单方面下架、冻结并终止合作，且不因此对卖家承担违约责任。卖家能做的是提前建立内部响应通道——监控 Safety Gate、CPSC Recall 与平台安全中心通知，在监管方或平台定性之前完成自查与主动上报，把节奏握在自己手里。</p>\n<p>召回有效性用完成率量化，它是监管方是否批准终止召回的核心指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>已回收</mtext></msub><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>已售出</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>可达率</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta = \\frac{N_{\\text{已回收}}}{N_{\\text{已售出}} \\times r_{\\text{可达率}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">已售出</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">可达率</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">已回收</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>可达率</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{可达率}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">可达率</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是能够被有效触达的消费者比例（有联系方式且地址有效）。跨境场景下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>可达率</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{可达率}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">可达率</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 往往偏低，因为平台出于隐私通常不直接提供买家联系方式，只能通过站内信触达，这会显著拉低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span>，进而成为监管方拒绝终止召回的理由。提前在包裹中加入保修登记或产品注册入口，实质上是在为未来的召回预建触达通道。监管数字与窗口期会持续修订，落地前以 CPSC、欧盟委员会与市场监管总局的最新公告为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>自愿 vs 强制</strong>的分界线不是危害大小，而是监管方是否先于企业完成定性；法定报告窗口（CPSA 24 小时、GPSR 不迟延）是决定走哪条通道的关键闸门。</li>\n<li><strong>判定结构可形式化</strong>：用期望危害 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[H]=\\sum p_i s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 排序，但严重度是硬约束，不能用概率稀释。</li>\n<li><strong>法域义务独立</strong>：同一批货可能同时触发 CPSA、GPSR、ACCC 与国内《消费品召回管理暂行规定》的独立报告义务，不能只盯一个市场。</li>\n<li><strong>三方分配的依据</strong>是法定报告义务、可追溯数据控制权与缺陷成因，而非离消费者的距离。</li>\n<li><strong>平台转嫁的是执行成本</strong>，法规责任仍在卖家与供应商之间按合同和过错分担。</li>\n<li><strong>可追溯数据是财务防线</strong>：没有批次映射，追偿归零；没有触达通道，完成率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 无法达标，召回无法终止。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"强制召回与自愿召回的判定机制及平台-卖家-供应商责任分配","id":"强制召回与自愿召回的判定机制及平台-卖家-供应商责任分配"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：自愿与强制是同一连续区间的两端","id":"核心概念-自愿与强制是同一连续区间的两端"},{"level":2,"text":"触发阈值：重大产品危害的形式化","id":"触发阈值-重大产品危害的形式化"},{"level":2,"text":"主要法域的强制/自愿分界","id":"主要法域的强制-自愿分界"},{"level":2,"text":"平台-卖家-供应商的三方责任分配","id":"平台-卖家-供应商的三方责任分配"},{"level":2,"text":"责任分配的合同化落地","id":"责任分配的合同化落地"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多法域产品召回法律制度与触发条件对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-product-recall-safety-response/recall-regime-liability-model/multi-jurisdiction-recall-regime-comparison"},"next":{"title":"分法域通报时限、报告义务与监管接口矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-product-recall-safety-response/recall-regime-liability-model/notification-timeline-regulator-interface-map"}}